    "mush_lp_dropdowns_nd4qBM": {
      "type": "mush-lp-dropdowns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_nfFwNk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Clean Ingredients",
            "dropdown_content": "<p>Our organic plant-based liquid creamer is created to keep your cup simple, wholesome, and delicious. With zero seed oils, no artificial ingredients, and nothing ultra-processed, it delivers pure goodness you can feel great about. Boosted with Lion’s Mane for cognitive support and flavored with real ingredients like pure vanilla extract, Maca, and date syrup, it elevates every sip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_6kXKJj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "PCR Packaging",
            "dropdown_content": "<p>Post Consumer Recycled Plastic is plastic that has been collected from consumers after they have used a product, cleaned, and re-made into a new product.  PCR plastic reduces the amount of plastic waste in landfills, conserves natural resources, and lessens the need for virgin plastic production. It leads to lower CO2 emissions, reduced water and energy consumption during production, and a smaller environmental footprint compared to virgin plastic.  </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_r6jwdx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Creamer Color",
            "dropdown_content": "<p>Our Caramel and Vanilla Superfood Creamers naturally have a slightly brown color because they’re sweetened with coconut sugar. This rich, golden sugar gives the liquid creamer its warm hue. Just be sure to pour to the recommended serving size rather than relying on color as your guide.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_nfFwNk",
        "text_6kXKJj",
        "text_r6jwdx"
      ],
